DESCRIPTION:Join us for the opening reception of Corcoran students show\, 
 Compositions \, which celebrates the power of creative collaborations. Com
 positions celebrates the power of creative collaborations and questioning 
 through the making process. It represents the work of over forty students
 \, as well as staff\, visiting artists\, and several community members—h
 olding a moment in time and process\, marking the end of one semester and 
 potential of the next. This collective energy provokes reflection on the d
 uality of what we hear and unhear\, see and unsee\, and honor or ignore. R
 E:REDACTED RE:REDACTED presents collaborative and individual works by the 
 class “Call & Response: Building the World We Want.” Thro\nCategory: A
