UID:59ea6c840e6be7c7eb520be9008a@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Talks &amp\; Tours\,New Orleans\,United States
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of the reinstalled Art of the Americas gallerie
 s highlighting Viceregal Peruvian painting\, the museum is hosting guided 
 gallery tours and a panel discussion focused on NOMA’s extraordinary col
 lection of 17th- and 18th-century Peruvian Viceregal works from the Arts o
 f the Americas collection holdings. The panel discussion will feature Lapi
 s Curator of the Arts of the Americas Dr. Orlando Hernández Ying\, along 
 with guest speakers. The NOMA Museum Shop will also be open all evening fo
 r gifts and merchandise related to the installations. This event is free w
 ith museum admission\, with registration highly recommended. Admission is 
 free for Louisiana residents every Wednesday\, courte\nCategory: Talks &am
 p\; Tours\nOriginal listing: https://noma.org/event/gallery-tour-and-panel
 -discussion-art-evangelization-and-the-early-modern-globalization-of-visua
 l-culture/
