 eloved holiday traditions! Returning for its 17th year\, we invite you to 
 lift your voices with us for beloved carols and new classics alike\, ringi
 ng in the holiday season with joy\, spirit\, and togetherness. Featuring o
 ur joyous 180-voice chorus\, brass\, organ\, magical lights\, and extra sp
 ecial guests\, this family-friendly concert celebrates the pervasive hope 
 of the holidays for a better\, kinder world. There is an overall 15 ticket
  limit for this event.\nCategory: Arts & Culture\nOriginal listing: https:
